c this test is to test pure elimination for the immediate case, and the cascading case
c so in this instance, we should immediately remove -1
c after -1 is removed, we see that only cause `2 3 0` and `-2 3 0` remains
c thus, we can perform another instance of pure elimination on 3
c note taht if we haven't done pure elimination on -1, 3 wasn't a pure literal at all, it is only pure
c after we removed -1
p cnf 3 5
-1 2 0
3 -1 0
2 3 0
-2 3 0
-1 -3 0
